===Etymology===
From {{term|centre}} + {{term|board}}.

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

# {{nautical}} The adjustable [[keel]] on a small [[yacht]] or [[dinghy]] that acts, among other things, as [[ballast]] and to counteract the sideways force of the wind.

